window.products.push({"id":1052065,"name":"Foldable Bathtub Caddy Tray, Bamboo Bath Tub Tray Table for Tub with Wine Glass Holder Book Phone Tablet Holder with Extending Sides, Adjustable Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSw-bT1XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉🛀✅-LUXURY SPA FOR BATH-If your ideal way to destress begins with a warm bubble bath, you deserve to upgrade your bathroom for a more spa-like experience—and that's where a foldable bathtub tray comes in. This bath tray consists of many practical components which can meet all needs during your bath time. Everything you need will be right at your fingertips and you can do whatever you want even if you’re taking a bath. The bamboo bathtub tray made your bath time a spa day for yourself. 👉🛀✅-FOLDABLE DESIGN-Unlike common bamboo bathtub caddy tray, we specially designed a foldable structure, so you can fold it when not in use, which is convenient for storage and saves space. Made with durable bamboo, the bath tub tray table is eco-friendly. And this bath tub tray comes fully assembled, so you won't have to work hard to put it together before, you enjoy a relaxing bath. 👉🛀✅MULTIFUNCTIONAL BATHTUB CADDY TRAY- Designed with several compartments includes cell phone tray, wine glass holder and two detachable SPA trays, this large bathtub tray holds everything like phone, books, wine, candle, or other bath accessories you want to bring with your while you relax in the tub. Besides, it features three reading angles for ideal viewing experience of your book or tablet. 👉🛀✅EXPANDABLE BATH TRAY-No tools needed, you can adjust this bathtub tray caddy length from 30 inches to 43 inches to fit most bathtub size. With bamboo bath caddy tray, you can enjoy your relaxing time in your own bathtub. 👉🛀✅NON-SLIP SILICONE-Our bath tray for tub comes with four non-slip silicone pads, it can grip on the lining of the tub, no need to worry about books, phones or candles falling into the water, just enjoy your luxury spa time. 👉🛀✅FITS MOST BATHTUB Most-With adjustable sides to fit most tubs, this Bathtub Caddy Tray has multiple compartments to organize all your bath essentials—featuring a drink holder, a phone slot for tub entertainment, a place for soap, and more. 👉🛀 🎁PERFEACT GIFT-Bamboo Bathtub Caddy a must for those who love to relax in the tub with bubbles, music and a glass of wine so it is your perfect gifts choices! Send this fabulous gift of love and relaxation to your wife, girlfriend, beloved ones, and friends on Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Valentine’s Day, Birthdays, Weddings, Anniversaries and all sorts of occasion. 👉🛀 💯MONEY BACK GUARANTEE- We take pride in the quality of our bamboo bathtub caddy. If ever disappointed with your bamboo bath caddy purchase, we will swiftly refund you your money; just contact one of our customer service representatives and we will gladly help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSw-bT1XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESHOF","source_asin":"B0BQGJSBMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQGJSBMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQGJSBMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
