window.products.push({"id":1052078,"name":"Bello TPC2127 Triple Play Fits Upto 55-Inch TV (Black) (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C96FrzsEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This unique and versatile design offers 3 configuration options to meet your display and room layout. It can accommodate most Flat Panel TVs up to 55\" or 125 lbs. and up to 4 A/V components. The rear mounting frame and universal swivel mounting system can be removed so that the system can be used as a 3-shelf stand-alone table, or the swivel mounting system can be removed and hung on the wall. It features black tempered safety glass shelves and a High Gloss Black scratch resistant powder-coated metal frame. Includes multiple decorative panel inserts that allow you to choose from six different color and wood finishes to match any room decor. It also includes an integrated CMS Cable Management System to hide and organize unsightly wires and interconnect cables. From the Manufacturer This unique and versatile design offers 3 configuration options to meet your display and room layout. It can accommodate most flat-panel HDTVs up to 55\" or 125 lbs. and four A/V components. The rear mounting frame and universal swivel mounting system can be removed so that the system can be used as a 3-shelf stand-alone table, or the swivel mounting system can be removed and hung on the wall. It features black tempered safety glass shelves and a High Gloss Black scratch-resistant powder-coated metal frame. Includes multiple decorative panel inserts that allow you to choose from six different color and wood finishes to match any room decor. It also includes an integrated CMS Cable Management System to hide and organize unsightly wires and interconnect cables. Versatile design offers 3 configuration options to meet your display and room layout. View larger Solid Frame Construction The Bell'O TPC-2127 is designed to accommodate four audio video components in addition to your large HDTV. The top shelf will hold flat-panel HDTVs up to 55\" and handle up to 125 lbs., so it will work with the most popular size models on the market today. The two lower fixed tempered glass component shelves can be used for your audio video components or even a center channel speaker if you are setting up a surround sound system in your home. Bell'O's Cable Management System (CMS) Hides Unsightly Cables and Wires CMS (Cable Management System) is a Bell'O-exclusive design element which hides unsightly wiring so your equipment is handsomely shown and enhances your home decor. Having a powerful home theater is great, but with it comes many cables and connections that can get in the way of the full home theater experience. Bell'O's CMS is a simple, easy-to-use method of organizing all those cables to ensure no unsightly wires take away from your home decor. Now you can have a home theater that's as beautiful as it is powerful. Includes six decorative panel inserts for a custom look. View larger Simple, Do-It-Yourself Assembly (and Disassembly) All Bell'O products include complete assembly instructions, and include all fasteners and tools needed. Average do-it-yourself skill is all that is required. And while other affordable options for home theater furniture exist, none expand and move with you as easily as Bell'O stands. Easily moved due to its modular design and KD disassembly and reassembly, Bell'O uniquely combines the strength of steel with tempered glass in exclusive designs that are timeless and enhance your home decor. Since Bell'O structures are made of steel and/or real wood they can be easily disassembled and reassembled with no damage. Unlike much composition or traditional KD wood furniture, Bell'O can be disassembled and reassembled countless times without suffering any damage, or weakening of its structure. The color and design remain consistent and you are not faced with obsolescence as you add components to your entertainment or home office location. About Bell'O At Bell'O, exceeding your expectations is not just a goal, it's everything. The functional and aesthetic designs of Bell'O's audio/video furniture, flat panel TV wall mounts, and accessories are representative of the extraordinary attention to detail that has made Bell'O world renowned. No matter what the product, Bell'O seeks to improve and innovate. Today Bell'O is much more than just quality audio/video furniture. The recent additions of TV wall mounting kits, customized home theater seating systems, and finest quality A/V cables and cleaning accessories have received extraordinary reviews from both media and consumers. These award-winning designs combine beautiful aesthetics and functional design with clever features and ease of installation. Attention to detail with the end user in mind is what drives Bell'O to manufacture products that make a home theater experience unlike any other. Precision-formed steel and cast metals are elegantly protected with a powder-coated, scratch-resistant finish. Products are constructed of high quality materials such as tempered safety glass shelves, real wood and wood veneers, and authentic leather and leather-matched materials","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C96FrzsEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bell'O","source_asin":"B002IT1E0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002IT1E0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002IT1E0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
