window.products.push({"id":1052186,"name":"Measuring Cup and Measuring Spoon Set in Stainless Steel with Silicone Handles by Housely. Decorative Non-magnetic Metal For Dry Measurement Without A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-8XetdHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Housely measuring cup and measuring spoon set is a professional grade cooking tool for the everyday at home chef! You'll never have a cake fall apart on you again when you bake using these decorative and accurate measuring cups. ➤ 5 Measuring Cup volumes: 1/8 cup, 1/4 cup , 1/3 cup, 1/2 cup, 1 cup ➤ 5 Measuring Spoon volumes: 1/4 tsp, 1/2 tsp, 1 tsp, 1/2 tbsp, 1 tbsp ➤ 2 detachable rings ➤ High quality stainless steel. If you own a cheap set of measuring cups and spoons, you'll easily feel the difference in quality just by the weight of these in your hand.  ➤ Capacities in U.S and metric are engraved in the handles of both the cups and spoons.  ➤ Dishwasher safe (wash prior to first use)➤ Durable comfortable easy grip silicone handles. The silicone grips can be removed.  ➤ Orange, purple, blue, pink and green handles will have your guests commenting in the kitchen about how cool and cute your measuring cups and spoons are.  ➤ Flat bottom cups to avoid spills  ➤ Long handles make it easy to reach in and out of jars and containers.  ➤ Fast and precise measuring of your ingredients. Never worry about using too much flour again!  ➤ The last set of measuring cups and measuring spoons you will ever need to buy. Packaging: No messy stickers or labels to remove! This set comes packaged in the box you see in the listing images above. Inside the box the set is covered with a plastic sleeve to prevent scratches during shipping. 100% Money Back Guarantee From Housely Housely is so confident that this will be the best and last set of measuring cups and spoons that you ever buy, that we give our customers a 90 day, no questions asked, 100% money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-8XetdHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Housely","source_asin":"B01CPULEAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CPULEAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CPULEAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
