window.products.push({"id":1052221,"name":"Kitchen Elements Potobelo Comfort Grip Stainless Steel 10-piece Cookware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ym2t5wgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 10-piece stainless steel cookware set has a stylish look that is functional and durable. Stainless steel is a popular all-around cooking material because it heats quickly and evenly, while the aluminum-capped bases add energy efficiency and excellent heat retention. This cookware doesn't react to acidic foods, resists corrosion and scratches, and cleans easily with just a sponge. High-arching handles covered in comfort grip silicone stay cool on the range and are oven-safe to 350-Degree F. Handles are riveted on for strength, they won't warp, bend, or break no matter how heavy the load or how often used. The saucepans, skillets, and sauté pan each feature a hanging hole on the end of the stylish, flared handle, so you can store and display them on any pot rack. Cookware is safe for gas, electric, and ceramic stove tops, and is safe in the oven up to 350-Degree F. Care instructions: Dishwasher safe, but to preserve the beauty of the cookware, recommend washing with hot soapy water and a sponge. Set includes: 2-Quart sauce pan with lid, 3-Quart sauce pan with lid, 5-Quart Dutch oven with lid, 3-1/2-Quart covered sauté with helper handle and lid, 8-inch fry pan, 9-1/2-inch fry pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ym2t5wgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Elements","source_asin":"B004QGXO1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QGXO1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QGXO1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1052222,"name":"Wildkin Kids Princess Chaise Lounge with Storage, Features Toy Box Bench Seat Safety Hinge, Two Carrying Handles, and Removable Back, Arm, and Seat Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711bu7J7hES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wildkin’s Princess Fainting Couch with Storage is the perfect playroom addition for the little princess in your life! Measuring 32 x 15.5 x 27 inches, this couch is perfectly sized for luxurious lounging. The Princess Fainting Couch with Storage is full of special touches that your own royal highness will love. Each couch comes with removable back, arm, and seat cushions in a rich, royal purple. The base of the Fainting Couch is inscribed with a special message – “Her Royal Highness” – that will make your little one feel simply aristocratic. Wildkin’s Princess Fainting Couch with Storage combines bold, colorful designs with practical features for a play room accessory that’s both fun and functional. Your little one will love the spacious interior that’s perfect for stashing toys and trinkets. Parents will love the two convenient side handles and pinch-proof safety hinge for protecting little fingers. – Each Princess Fainting Couch with Storage was created with your child’s safety and stability in mind. Made of a super strong, durable MDF and solid wood blend, you won’t have to worry about your couch malfunctioning. Just follow the included assembly instructions and your little one will be on their way to a magnificent experience. Each Princess Fainting Couch with Storage was designed to coordinate with other Wildkin décor. From bedding, to table and chair sets, to rocking chairs, your child will love seeing their favorite designs pop up throughout the house! Recommended for children ages 3+ with a max weight of 100 lbs. Spot clean only with a non-bleach wipe. Dry cleaning recommended for back and seat cushions. 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711bu7J7hES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B0BRXDBGN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXDBGN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXDBGN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
