window.products.push({"id":1052307,"name":"EHEYCIGA Sherpa Blanket Twin Size - Fuzzy Sherpa Fleece Blanket Twin Size Super Soft Plush Blanket, Thick Winter Blanket, Black, 60x80 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cusvqBt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Quality & Long-lasting Durability: Tight and neat stitches make the joints more secure and extend the life of the blanket. Even after countless washings, it will not off-line, fade or lose its softness and luster. They are almost as soft and warm as a wool blanket, making them a great alternative for people. Double-Sized Design: One side is super soft 220 GSM flannel which is cosy and warm and the other side is 260 GSM ultra soft sherpa. Different materials offer you different amazing comfy feelings. The decorative line design of the fleece blanket is reversible. Versatile Usage Scenarios: The Sherpa fleece blanket is perfect as a couch blanket, cuddly blanket, sofa blanket, bed throw, sofa throw blanket, office chair bullet blanket and outdoor travel blanket. The fluffy cuddly keeps you warm and cosy while you taking a nap, watching TV, reading books, relaxing yourself on the deckchair and camping. It's also suitable for your pets. Ideal Gift Choice: All of our fleece blankets come well packaged. This fleece blanket is the ideal gift for family and friends on a variety of occasions, including Father's Day, Mother's Day, birthdays, Christmas, New Year's, housewarming or back to school. Guarantee and Maintenance: Please use mild water below 86°F, use a mild detergent to wash and clean it without bleach. We provide free exchange and return service within 30 days.  If you have any questions about our products, please contact us as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cusvqBt-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EHEYCIGA","source_asin":"B0BV6TXL21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV6TXL21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV6TXL21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1052308,"name":"SACHUKOT Unique Wine Aerator Pourer–Drop Stop Wine Pourer with Latest Aeration Technology–Glass Wine Pourer–Quick Aerating Decanter for Wine–Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tkwEgtNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine Needs to Breathe -Wine that has been allowed to breathe tastes better.As wine breathes,it opens up,and releases its intended aromas and flavours.  -Traditionally,decanters were used to aerate wine.However,decanting is time consuming,cumbersome and inconvenient.  -SACHUKOT's design speeds up this process with ease and convenience.  -Perfect aeration in the time it takes to pour a glass.  Aerate your wine to perfection instantly The SACHUKOT Wine Aerator Pourer has a large aerating chamher and air intake system that utilizes the Bernoulli Effect to infuse your wine with the optimal amount of oxygen.  Double the value of your wine by simply pouring yourself a glass!  All The Taste With None of The Wait -SACHUKOT draws in and mixes the proper amount of air for the right amount of time,allowing your wine to breathe instantly.  -You'll notice a better bouquet,enhanced flavours and smoother finish.  -It's that fast.It's that easy.  Box contains -1*wine aerator -1*filter -1*stand LIFETIME MANUFACTURER’S GUARANTEE - To prove how confident we are in our product, we offer a lifetime money back guarantee with every purchase! If you are not completely satisfied with your aerator, we will refund your purchase with no exception!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tkwEgtNwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SACHUKOT","source_asin":"B07Q5ZJX57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q5ZJX57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q5ZJX57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
