window.products.push({"id":1052328,"name":"DDDDXO Golden Girls Wine Glasses, Golden Girls Merchandise, Golden Girls Stemless Wine Glass Set of 4, Golden Girls Inspired Gifts for Women, Golden T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y39uoB2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relive Memories - What's better than giving these funny stemless wine glasses to a wine lover also Golden Girls fanatic? Every time they drink their precious wine and looking these comedic foursome girls, they will think of you. Each glass features one of the leading ladies and their popular quotes from the classic sitcom. Relive your favorite memories from the classic show Golden Girls. Fans will find their favorite girls with their popular quotes. Hilarious Design - Channel your inner Golden Girls. There is a funny comedic foursome: Rose, Sophia, Blanche, and Dorothy. Every wine glass is unique featuring a girl and a funny saying. This Golden Girls-themed wine glass set features your favorite sitcom foursome. Bring some character to your table with these stemless glasses and get a nostalgic feeling. Premium Quality Material - Made with high-quality glass, durable and sturdy, the paint won't fade after being washed in the dishwasher. The broad base makes the glass tip resistant to prevent spills and sloshes. This Golden Girls stemless wine glass features a wide, flat bottom to provide a stable surface area. Its ergonomic design and the curve of stemless wine glass perfectly fits in your hand so it is very friendly for you and your friends. Unique Gift Idea - These Golden Girls wine glasses make a great gift for birthdays, new houses, bachelorette parties, girl's nights, White elephant, Christmas, housewarming, and hostess presents. Great birthday gift for women, friends, coworkers, girls, friends, besties, golden girls lovers... Comes in a set of 4, and holds 15 oz. Comes in a gift box, the perfect gift for any occasion. Enjoy Your Night - The golden girl wine glasses make drinking your favorite wine, red or white, vino, spirits, or adult beverage lol funny guaranteed! It can hold cocktails, juice, champagne, whiskey, beer, yogurt, and milk. We recommend you hand wash to expand the life span. Please feel free to contact us with any problems with our wine glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y39uoB2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DDDDXO","source_asin":"B0C1MRVP96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1MRVP96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1MRVP96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1052329,"name":"Portable Mini Humidifier, 320ml Small Cool Mist Humidifier, USB Personal Desktop Humidifier for Bedroom Home Office Baby Car Travel, Ultra-Quiet, 2 Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hSf3kqR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PORTABLE MINI HUMIDIFIER - This 320ml humidifier is small in size, light in weight and easy to carry which can be powered by any USB port to give you fresh air. Space-saving design make you can easily pack it in your handbags, backpacks and suitcases to take it anywhere. Perfect for bedroom nightstand, office desk , baby nursery, cup holder in car, travel, etc. ERGONOMIC NOZZLE DESIGN - The small USB humidifier features a 35° titled nozzle which spreads the mist to refresh the surrounding dry air and keep your skin full moisturized, effectively avoid wetting the wall or desktop. Leak proof design reduces the possibility of accidental spills. WHISPER QUIET & AUTO SHUT-OFF - Small body but works powerfully at a low noise level. The personal humidifier will bring you quality sleep and disturbance-free work environment. With intelligent anti-dry function, this mini desktop humidifier will power off automatically after running up to 8 hours, greatly ensuring your safety. TWO MIST MODES & LONG-LASTING - Having two modes, when you press the button first time, the mini humidifier will continuously spray for 10 hours. When you press again and it will intermittently spray up to 20 hours. Quite easy to operate and great help in moisturizing the dry air for longer time, no need to add water at night. NIGHT LIGHT MODE - This portable desktop humidifier can offer warm night light when spraying the mist, giving you better sleep to improve your sleep quality. Simply long press the button for 2 seconds to turn on the night light, long press again to turn off it. Totally won't disturb your sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hSf3kqR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikikin","source_asin":"B08HGJTF71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HGJTF71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HGJTF71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
