window.products.push({"id":1052387,"name":"Invent Toki Manual Coffee Grinder - 80ml Portable Hand-Operated Grind Machine with Adjustable Coarseness - Set Includes Scoop, Cleaning Brush, Funnel,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81smiMZgvKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever wished to have freshly ground coffee on the go? Nothing compares to a cup of joe specially made from freshly ground coffee beans. The distinctive aroma of your chosen blend is still very much pronounced while the flavor remains untainted. Unfortunately, you're only able to enjoy it at home or in specialty coffee shops. If only it was possible to grind your favorite beans in the office, on a trip, or wherever you need to be. Make flavorful coffee-based drinks with ease using the Invent Toki Manual Coffee Grinder. Gone are the days when you have to settle for unpleasant pre-ground coffee while stuck in the office or camping out with your best buds. With this travel-friendly coffee beans mill, you can grind the finest selection of arabica, robusta, liberica, and excelsa beans no matter where you have to be. Our food-safe and BPA-free coffee beans grinder can provide you with the ideal grind consistency. It will be the best partner for your drip coffee maker, thermal coffee maker, espresso machine, percolater, siphon coffee maker, french press, aeropress, or moka pot. Simply turn its adjustment knob to choose from coarse, medium, or fine grounds. To make it even easier for you to bring this ingenious coffee bean grinder to road trips, hikes and beach getaways, we’re also giving you a carrying bag. The thoughtful addition will keep your mill set protected from the elements as you go out and about. Need more reasons to get our innovative coffee mill? Check out these benefits: ✅ Great gift for single-origin coffee drinkers ✅ Hand crank is effortless to use ✅ Lightweight and quiet Create your coffee blend the way you want it. Add the Invent Toki Manual Coffee Grinder to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81smiMZgvKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Invent Toki","source_asin":"B087171R8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087171R8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087171R8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
