window.products.push({"id":1052406,"name":"Lover's Collection - His & Her's Matching Metal Filigree Laser Cut Masquerade Mask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tw7n-8tL._AC_.jpg","description":"A centuries-old tradition of Venice, Italy, Venetian masks are typically worn during the Carnival of Venice but have become extremely popular for many different occasions where hiding the wearer's identity and social status is the goal or just for the fun of it at masquerade balls or parties. Many a romantic encounter has been initiated wearing Venetian masks and they have become trendy in the 21st century for all types of parties and events over and beyond the traditional Mardi Gras theme. Also trending right now is masquerade themed weddings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tw7n-8tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masquerade Fashion","source_asin":"B00HFYUB1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HFYUB1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HFYUB1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
