window.products.push({"id":1052415,"name":"Americanflat 36 Inch White Floating Shelf with Lip - Long Wall Mounted Storage Ledge for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Office and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yo8Cet6iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and Functional Design: Enhance the beauty of your cherished keepsakes and collectibles with these attractive white floating shelf. These shelves offer a sleek and polished look that effortlessly fits into any home decor. Display your favorite items with pride while adding a touch of modern elegance to your living space. These shelves are thoughtfully crafted to provide a perfect blend of style and practicality, allowing you to organize and showcase your treasures in a way that is both visually pleasing and convenient. Versatile Dimensions: Experience the flexibility of our ledge, measuring 36 inches in length and 4 inches in width, to proudly display your prized possessions. This set of six screw covers is thoughtfully included, ensuring a seamless and polished appearance. Adhesive shelves or no drill floating shelves, if power tools are not readily available or if you prefer to showcase lighter items, you have the option to conveniently utilize Command strips for hassle-free installation. Please note that hanging hardware is not included, allowing you to choose the most suitable mounting method based on your specific needs. Use and Display: Providing additional storage space while creating a sophisticated display, this wall ledge adds function and character to any home or office. Material: Made of wood composite material; great care is taken in the manufacturing and all our products are built to last; the sturdy ledge will hold all of your favorite collectibles in place; hanging hardware (screws) not included. Protective Packaging: Americanflat developed exclusive proprietary packaging that helps ensure safe delivery of fragile and glass items; order with confidence, click and add to cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yo8Cet6iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Americanflat","source_asin":"B07G3JZ8YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G3JZ8YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G3JZ8YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
