window.products.push({"id":1052418,"name":"13'' Christmas Santa Claus Snowboarding Figurines Decorations with Solar Light, Mrsvirop Resin Indoor Outdoor Christmas Figurines Table Statues Collec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDH39+TYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE AND ADORABLE - Our Santa Clause statues are built with the highest quality resin and paints that are durable, weatherproof, and won’t fade from the sun. And hand-painted in bright colors to Make it come alive. CHRISTMAS DECORATION FOR INDOOR OUTDOOR: Everyone has their own Christmas dream, these adorable accessories for Christmas villages are suitable for every age group. As a gift to friends and family, they can enjoy the happiness of the holiday.Ski Santa clause decorations: 13*8*5 inch, perfect for your indoor and outdoor Christmas & Holiday Decor. Ideal Christmas gift for your family or friends and matches your Christmas party theme. 12-16 HOURS SOLAR LIGHT: Renewable and clean energy - Our santa clause decorations equipped with advanced solar chips, turn the lantern on and leave it in the \"on\" position during the daytime, then keep the product under the sun to ensure sufficient sunlight. The LED lights will fully charge within 6-8 hours and will light up for 12-16 hours. (Don't let solar panel covered by the leaf or branch) WIDELY USED: This Santa decorations with solar light is a awesome Christmas home decor. It is ot only suitable for outdoor, like the garden, patio, lawn, flowerbed, fence and porch, but also can be a great addition for your staircase, mantel, tabletop display or under your Christmas tree. Make your space looks unique. QUALITY PRODUCT & ATTENTIVE SERVICE: Our store not only has durable and adorable statue home decor, but also very considerate service. Before or after purchase, If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, Mrsivrop is committed to providing each customer with the highest standard of customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UDH39+TYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrsivrop","source_asin":"B0BDFQMNR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFQMNR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFQMNR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
