window.products.push({"id":1052580,"name":"Muscle Man and Mighty Woman Color Changing Mug: Heat Sensitive Mug Weak to Strong Cartoon - Novelty Ceramic Coffee Mugs, 11 Oz (Muscle Man - Black, Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mdNBtWf5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"COLOR CHANGING  Add a shot of motivation to your morning coffee with a funny heat sensitive color changing mug from The Kendt Collection. Just pour your favorite hot beverage to reveal the brand name and change the background color from black to tan with the muscle man mug or black to pink with the mighty woman mug. As the mug warms, the weak, struggling weightlifter transforms into a strong, successful powerlifter. The changing design helps you keep tabs on your coffee temperature and gives you that little burst of motivation to make it through your morning and your workout.   HOT & STRONG  Our heat changing mug has a one-of-a-kind design that everyone can relate to. Our mighty woman struggles to do a weighted barbell squat and our muscle man can barely lift a weighted barbell off the ground, but after a cup of coffee or other hot beverage, they magically transform into a fit, toned muscle couple who can press the weighted barbell each with just one hand. If a simple cup of coffee can turn struggling lightweights into a mighty powerhouse, imagine how it will transform your morning!   FUN GIFT  This is the perfect set of mugs for just about anyone or couple. Surprise him or her with this clever temperature changing mug set as a symbol of partnership and enduring strength. The unique design also make these funny magic mugs a great gift for personal trainers, gym teachers and weightlifters of all strength levels. These cool cute novelty coffee mugs are also a great stocking stuffer for coffee lovers, coworkers, and bosses.   11 OZ CAPACITY  Don’t go to work on an empty tank! Our classic 11 ounce mugs hold enough fuel to get you through those dreary morning meetings. Jumpstart your morning routine with a steaming hot beverage like coffee, tea, or hot chocolate in your mighty woman or muscle man mug. Made from high quality, durable ceramic material. Microwavable, but may cause fading. Hand wash to preserve design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mdNBtWf5L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kendt Collection","source_asin":"B07CH2QN2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CH2QN2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CH2QN2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
