window.products.push({"id":1052615,"name":"Hypnotic Gems Materials: 1/4 lb Bulk Rough Shungite Stones from Russia - 1/4\" to 1/2\" - Natural Raw Rough Gemstone Supplies for Wicca, Reiki, and Ener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDwKskLKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Hypnotic Gems brand of Rough Shungite comes from an a full mine run of hard to get 100% Natural Shungite from Russia. These stones are in the rough and are sent to you exactly as they came out of the ground. As a natural carbon based stone they may leave a completely natural \"residue\" when initially handled which is fine carbon from where the stones were naturally broken during mining and they are still covered in a thin layer of carbon dust since they have not been washed or processed in any way. This is 100% unprocessed, powerful, natural rough shungite! These stones are sold by total weight and not by number of pieces and the exact number of pieces you will receive may vary from our image.Shungite is sometimes called \"The Miracle Stone\" since it is one of the most powerful stones in the world. It has the ability to cure, rescue, purify, charge, heal, protect, and even promote growth in living organisms. Shungite is calming and relaxing and it brings not only physical protection but also psychic protection. It shields from electro-magnetic radiation given off by electrical equipment such as computers, mobile phones and microwaves. Shungite contains natural fullerenes which are powerful anti-oxidants and in lore many people have used water that has been purified with these stones to help with burns, cuts, callosities, and other ailments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDwKskLKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B014QUQ1XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014QUQ1XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014QUQ1XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1052616,"name":"The Original Sheet Suspender Brand Elite New and Improved with 5 yr. Warranty!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VFCUdqBJL._AC_SL1099_.jpg","description":"New and improved, modifications based on customer feedback, only sold by Suspenders USA! Made in the USA. Sheet Suspenders are two (2) individual suspender straps made of the finest woven elastic that adjust to any size. Most importantly, Sheet Suspenders are easily slipped under any type/size mattress, even a baby’s crib to form a cris cross. There is absolutely no lifting of the mattress necessary and they need be applied only once! The four easy-open clips have nylon inserts that will not damage sheets. As seen on Good Morning America & Tested, Approved and Recommended by Good Housekeeping Institute for crib sheets. Perfect for any bed from Boats to RVs and even waterbeds. Sheet Suspenders was invented & patented in 1988, after an accident resulting in spinal cord surgery that left the inventor bedridden close to a year. While in bed she discovered there was no way to keep fitted sheets securely on the mattress, they kept slipping off the corners. With strict back limitations of \"No Lifting or Bending\", she invented the perfect solution! Sheet Suspenders . When changing the sheets, do not lift the mattress. The weight of the mattress keeps suspender straps in place. Lift four corners of fitted sheet a little, unclip. Put new sheet on and re-clip four corners. For all mattresses, first time: Put fitted sheet on. Lift corner of sheet & clip suspender strap to sheet, tuck sheet corner back under. Walk suspender along side of bed to the opposite (diagonal) corner, while slipping suspender under the mattress. lift corner of sheet & clip, tuck back under. Repeat steps 1 & 2 on opposite corners to form an \"X\". Slides should face foot of bed for adjustments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VFCUdqBJL._AC_SL1099_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheet Suspenders","source_asin":"B0042VJLT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0042VJLT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0042VJLT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
