window.products.push({"id":1052944,"name":"TOYMAYS HOME Wood Dough Bowl for Decor, 20.4L\"×11.4W\" Rustic Wooden Large Dough Bowl Tray, Hand Carved Dough Bowl for Home Decor Table Centerpiece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vzp66UyxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎃【Versatile Wood Dough Bowl】Our wooden dough bowl is versatile home decor. This wood bowl is perfectly sized for centerpiece decor accent for placed anywhere in home such as coffee table,dining table,kitchen counter,console tables and more. This item ships in 1 carton.It measures 20.4''L x 11.4'W x 5.9''H overall. 🎃【100% Solid Wood】Purely slightly hand-polished.Our dough bowls are made of paulownia wood,totally 100% solid wood,this material is strong and durable while very light in weight but not easy to break. This wood keeps the natural texture of tree.Each one has its unique in color and shape for the material reason.Wooden dough bowls for DECORATIVE PURPOSES ONLY and not for direct food contact; Not intended to hold liquid. 🎃【For Home Decorating】Our hand carved dough bowl in wood decorative bowl with various lengths and depths to hold a amount of farmhouse style objects like decorative orbs,sea glass,faux plants,or other more decorative crafts in any season-Christmas,fall,Thanksgiving,Halloween,Easter,etc. So you can change up the decor in it often to suit the season! Also our wood bowl is suitable for your keys,watches or small objects. 🎃【Rustic Style】This wood dough bowl for decor is sure adding some rustic charm to your home any space. A versatile brown finish and a hand-carved look give this piece its farmhouse charm.One-of-a-kind vintage dough bowl with a distressed rustic and coarse texture and an elegant but lightweight appeal. 🎃【Goes in Most Home Style】Our each wood decorative bowl is unique,which brings warm and special feel to your home. Antique style dough bowl can adapt to a variety of home styles.Antique decorative bowls can also be placed in country farmhouses, cafes, offices and other places.Rustic wood dough bowls helps you improving the ambience and room style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vzp66UyxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TORMAYS HOME","source_asin":"B0BLZ11VRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1052944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLZ11VRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLZ11VRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
